<!--
  LS Immersive Life group crime intelligence catalog.

  This is authored reference data, not a dispatch queue. Every activity is
  explicitly autoDispatch="false" and intelOnly="true". No entry here spawns
  a scene, starts a pursuit, requests backup, or calls an audio event by itself.
  PoliceCore observes the authored location keys during quiet patrol and shows
  the result as a manual intelligence tip in the Police UI. After the officer
  deliberately begins a nearby investigation, LSPDCrimeActivity uses this
  data for its owned scene without creating a Dispatch incident.

  Coordinate values remain named keys rather than hard-coded event logic. The
  LSPDCrimeActivityEvent validates/selects this catalog, and the current Crime
  Activity owner resolves the supported keys for this GTA build. The catalog
  stays data-driven and easy to extend.
-->
